 *
 * Campaign Intelligence panel — shared by the setup wizard (step 4) and the
 * Settings page (Intelligence tab). The Settings context adds the engine
 * historical imports (catalog / customers / orders). Catalog/customer/order
 * sync itself has no on/off toggle — connecting the engine syncs everything
 * (target-spec §4.2 decision 4). Behavior lives in panel/panels-js.phtml.
 *
 * @var \Magento\Backend\Block\Template $block
 * @var \Magento\Framework\Escaper $escaper
